@startuml
title SmartOmni — System Context
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
rectangle "SmartOmni System" as System
actor "Customer ( Guest )" as Guest
actor "E-commerce Marketplace (Shopee / TikTok Shop)" as Marketplace
actor "Tenant Admin" as TenantAdmin
actor "Staff" as Staff
actor "Super Admin" as SuperAdmin
actor "SaaS Payment Gateway" as PaymentGateway
actor "Email Delivery Provider" as EmailProvider

Guest --> System : Order claim details
System --> Guest : Product information and marketplace links
System --> Guest : AI consultation and recommendations
System --> Guest : Authentication and order claim results
Marketplace --> System : Customer-service messages
Marketplace --> System : Order, waybill and return events
Marketplace --> System : Product, price and warehouse data
Marketplace --> System : Authorization, scope and token data
System --> Marketplace : Inventory and price updates
System --> Marketplace : Shipment, cancellation and dispute details
System --> Marketplace : Customer-service replies
System --> Marketplace : Voucher creation request
System --> Marketplace : Authorization and catalog data requests
Guest --> System : Registration and login details
System --> Guest : Order status, loyalty points and tier
Marketplace --> System : Voucher creation result
TenantAdmin --> System : Product inquiry
TenantAdmin --> System : Subscription change request
TenantAdmin --> System : Voucher issuance details
TenantAdmin --> System : Support ticket
TenantAdmin --> System : Staff accounts and role assignments
TenantAdmin --> System : Tenant and shop configuration
System --> TenantAdmin : Voucher issuance and support results
System --> TenantAdmin : Business reports and AI insights
System --> TenantAdmin : Tenant, connection and subscription status
System --> Staff : Forecasts and inventory alerts
System --> Staff : Order, inventory and waybill information
System --> Staff : Inbox messages and complaint classification
System --> SuperAdmin : Audit records and security alerts
System --> SuperAdmin : Tenant and platform status
System --> EmailProvider : Password reset and notification content
Staff --> System : Customer-service reply content
Staff --> System : Order, shipment and return details
Staff --> System : Product, SKU, price and stock records
SuperAdmin --> System : Support resolution details
SuperAdmin --> System : Tenant and plan configuration
PaymentGateway --> System : Payment confirmation
EmailProvider --> System : Delivery status
System --> PaymentGateway : Subscription payment details
@enduml
